    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A bagel uses a grappling hook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> is a precision platformer where you must clear challenging levels by using the hole of a bagel as a grappling hook. Feel the pleasure of smooth swinging through tight momentum and responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An immersive bagel experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> delivers a highly immersive sense of movement, with precise physical feedback that makes you feel like you are truly a bagel riding the rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sensation of becoming a bagel as you overcome challenging levels filled with springs, bumpers, gravity-reversing zones, and other physics-based elements.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A bagel uses a grappling hook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> is a precision platformer where you must clear challenging levels by using the hole of a bagel as a grappling hook. Feel the pleasure of smooth swinging through tight momentum and responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An immersive bagel experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> delivers a highly immersive sense of movement, with precise physical feedback that makes you feel like you are truly a bagel riding the rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sensation of becoming a bagel as you overcome challenging levels filled with springs, bumpers, gravity-reversing zones, and other physics-based elements.</p>",
